{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"02fbb3fdaf7b84576303087511679c0c37aae396"},"timestamp":1427268878,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2NDIwMjAzNg==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/81","origin":"github"},"title":"Integrate with weboob","message":"Hi,\nI really like the idea behind the datalad project.\n\nSince the project will have to get data from the messy web and its primary language is python, I think it has a lot in common with weboob (http://weboob.org/).\n\nWeboob (web outside of browsers) provides a whole infrastructure (including a Browser class) that helps a lot structuring scraping interfaces, modules and applications. I think that if the scraping job would be put into weboob and used into datalad, then it would contribute even more to make this world a better place to live.","files":null}]}